ys > usually > sometimes > never.\nThứ trong tuần luôn viết hoa: Monday, Sunday.","lessonId":"u5n1l4","lessonVersion":"v2.u5n1l4","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u5n1","order":32,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u5n1l4","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec1","signature":"Pk8AU2L5xrZxdzyeXfFptqpUUVeuxB8AVasszMfVsnGlf5Ml-43oxy-OyvubWhP8Otg7IVHgIum_XQxcksorAg","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["speaking","u5.grammar","u5.dialogue","u5.vocab"],"title":"Mấy giờ rồi? · Bài 4","unitId":"u5"}